1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,510
“Rohan ‘exceeds’. He’s in every meeting.”

2
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:06,815
Kabir asked just one thing… “And the work, sir?”

3
00:00:06,815 --> 00:00:09,215
Appraisal week. Kabir shipped the fix…

4
00:00:09,215 --> 00:00:10,939
Rohan did the talking in meetings.

5
00:00:10,939 --> 00:00:12,903
Rating the work…

6
00:00:12,903 --> 00:00:15,172
or the face?

7
00:00:15,208 --> 00:00:16,754
It’s the halo effect—

8
00:00:16,754 --> 00:00:23,709
Thorndike, 1920. One overall impression colours every separate rating.

9
00:00:23,709 --> 00:00:24,891
Visibility shines…

10
00:00:24,891 --> 00:00:28,173
so ownership, quality, teamwork— all go up.

11
00:00:28,173 --> 00:00:32,449
Fight it: ‘attitude’. Stay quiet: ‘meets’.

12
00:00:32,449 --> 00:00:36,323
Riya: a one-page evidence doc, before calibration.

13
00:00:36,323 --> 00:00:42,641
Kabir wrote: “Sir, before the rating, please look at three things:

14
00:00:42,641 --> 00:00:44,678
work, impact, date.”

15
00:00:44,678 --> 00:00:55,315
Chanakya Niti: guṇair uttamatāṁ yāti, noccair āsana-saṁsthitaḥ…

16
00:00:55,315 --> 00:00:58,947
You rise by your qualities, not a high seat.

17
00:00:58,947 --> 00:01:03,386
A crow on a palace top… isn’t Garuda.

18
00:01:03,386 --> 00:01:05,067
The meeting room is that palace top.

19
00:01:05,067 --> 00:01:10,105
Your move: send the evidence doc… or wait for the rating?
